# Quellpaket (sdist): alles, was die Distributionen zum Bauen und Testen brauchen
include LICENSE ADDITIONAL-TERMS.md THIRD-PARTY.md CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md
include README.md README.en.md pytest.ini install.sh uninstall.sh
graft data
graft tests
graft tools
graft docs
exclude CLAUDE.md docs/VERLAUF.md
prune stick
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[co] *.ggh
